import "res://assets/dialogue/dialogue_scripts/7d-Az-ConditionalConvo-CellarGeneral.dialogue" as ConditionalConvo


~ trap
Winston: Aha! There you are, pint-size.
Fenn: Uh oh.
Az: You good?
Winston: Now, since you continue to be quite a thorn in my side... I figure I need a way to put a stop to your adventure
Fenn: Okay...
Winston: And what better way... than with...
Winston: A GIANT ICY CAGE!!!
As he says it, a large cage falls from the ceiling, directly on top of Fenn
=> END

~ escaped
Fenn escapes the trap with a quick leaf dash
Winston: Oh yeah... I- I forgot you could do that.
Fenn: That's okay. It's really not all that useful. I sometimes forget too.
Winston: Wh-what? No! It's cool, I just...
Winston: I thought you only had the bangles from the scary lady.
Az: I can hear you.
Fenn: Oh, yeah. Those are more helpful.
Winston: O-oh...
Winston: Anyways, I'm gonna... uh...
Winston: I'm gonna go plan your downfall.
Winston leaves

# Change this to something like "If heaters on == 0"
if true
	=> ConditionalConvo/start

=> END
